sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App
    participant Auth as Auth Backend
    participant Email as Email Provider

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over User,Auth: Login flow
    User->>App: Submit credentials
    App->>Auth: Login request
    Auth-->>App: Success or failure response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over User,Email: Forgot password flow
    User->>App: Request password reset
    App->>Auth: Forgot password request
    Auth->>Email: Send reset link
    Email-->>User: Reset email
    User->>App: Submit new password from link
    App->>Auth: Reset password request
    Auth-->>App: Reset result
    end
